From 37e7594ec617bd4b4de5a23a032a8e90e9695308 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahmetv10 <ahmetv10@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:30:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(ui): a light workbench theme and workspace tabs

The shell gets a light, warm-neutral workbench with a signal accent
(our own palette), and the ribbon carries a workspace tab row above
the cells - one tab per machine mode, switching through the same
undoable LoadBuiltinMachine the Machine door queues. The ribbon's
cell ink gains a tinted-palette hook for the command glyphs.
