Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(ui): a compact browser header and ordered rows

The browser heads with one chrome row - a View door, an Expand all
and a Collapse all - and the setup's furniture leads the rows:
Setups, WCS, Stock, Operations, Tool list, Fixtures, Machine, Post.
