Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:31:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(ui): camera tools in the viewport's control ribbon

The control ribbon grows four buttons: a Perspective/Orthographic
toggle (the View door's radios' true twin), and Orbit/Pan/Zoom tools
that latch the drag onto that mode whatever the mouse button - a
latched tool's click is no click at all. Releases end the drag as
before, and the status line names the latched tool.
