Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:31:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] refactor(ui): drop the Machine ribbon cell - the
 workspace tabs own the switch

The Machine door duplicated the workspace tab row's one switch onto
a second door; the tabs win. The Setup group keeps its four cells,
and the refused-Create gate route opens the active setup's Machine
page instead of a workspace list that no longer exists.
